  m_Name: C2LVL1-1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - <?BowleyStartShaking=15,15,1> CHARON, YOU SEE THIS RIGHT?!
  - "<?BowleyStartShaking=15,15,1> THEY MAKE SUCH A GOOD COUPLE DON\u2019T THEY?!"
  - "Well judging by how they\u2019re looking at us, surely it wasn\u2019t all sunshine
    and rainbows?"
  - <?BowleyStartShaking=5,15,3>  Charon, honey, how did YOUR last relationship go?
  - "Look, that wasn\u2019t going to go anywhere"
  - <?BowleyStartShaking=5,15,3> OH? How do YOU know that?
  - "Aphrodite got involved, said it wasn\u2019t going to work out"
  - <?BowleyStartShaking=5,15,3> AND YOU JUST LISTENED TO HER?
